    {
      "finding": "Failed proof outcomes were initially translated to typed exceptions before their database transaction committed.",
      "resolution": "Commit the immutable sanitized observation first, then raise its closed public error outside the transaction."
    },
    {
      "finding": "Preparation releases its transaction before network I/O, so multiple prepared requests could otherwise exceed the ten-attempt budget when recorded later.",
